flowchart LR
  UI[ScreenController] --> GW[EventGateway]
  GW -->|enqueue command| BUS[InProcessBus / Queue]
  BUS --> AUTH[Accounts / campaigns / profiles handlers]
  BUS --> ADMIT[Gameplay admission]
  ADMIT -->|context prepared| BUS
  BUS --> PLAN[Director model]
  PLAN -->|plan proposed| BUS
  BUS --> VALIDATE[Validation / disclosure / projection]
  VALIDATE -->|narration work ready| BUS
  BUS --> NARRATE[Narrator model]
  NARRATE -->|narration proposed| BUS
  BUS --> COMMIT[Persistence handler]
  COMMIT -->|atomic commit| SQL[SQLiteStore + pending notices]
  COMMIT -->|turn committed IDs| BUS
  BUS --> RESULT[Result subscriber]
  BUS --> REPORT[Independent report subscriber]
  SQL --> RECOVER[CompletionRecovery]
  RECOVER -->|notifications only| BUS
  AUTH & ADMIT & PLAN & VALIDATE & NARRATE & COMMIT & REPORT --> SHARED[Shared domain capabilities / adapters]
